  clock: 2  # f5a6
  nonce: f5a6  # f5a6
  message: "Dogfood re-confirmation. limits.analysis_depth='syntax_only' reproduced on a fresh /tmp fixture run: 31 semantic passes ran and the output carried extends + dispatches_to edges, yet analysis_depth still read 'syntax_only'. The field is declared at limits.py:99 and serialized at limits.py:180; grep for analysis_depth (excluding the dataclass and tests) returns no reassignment path. 0 doc hits in docs/schema.json and docs/hypergumbo-spec.md. A consumer gating on this field wrongly concludes only syntactic analysis occurred and discards valid semantic edges."  # f5a6
